  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decade Coordination Office for Challenge 10</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations proclaimed that the Decade of Ocean Science for Sustainable Development (Decade) will be held from 2021 to 2030. Critical to the success of the Ocean Decade is enhancing Ocean Literacy (OL) or the understanding of the ocean&apos;s influence on us and our influence on the ocean. This project aims at establishing a Decade Coordination Office (DCO) for Challenge 10, which aims to change humanity&apos;s relationship with the ocean through Ocean Literacy and an increased understanding of the cultural and social value of the ocean.</narrative>
  </description>
